    "body": "So your main problem is with step 16 of https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-http-network-fetch I suppose. That makes some of the things inconsistent here. We could provide dedicated support for gzip somehow, similarly to how it's tightly coupled in browsers, but that wouldn't necessarily address future schemes, if any.\r\n\r\nOne thing we could do is provide a request flag to disable step 16, but last I heard that would be fairly involved. And it's also fairly low-level and still makes you responsible for any compressing work.",
